; MIDASTOUCH — gold paper arm M1 preset (protocol-pinned forward config)
; Pins: docs/MIDASTOUCH_PROTOCOL.md §2/§10 Amendment 2 (forward collection on
; the plainest variant ORIGINAL, zero selection bias) + MIDASTOUCH_CLOSEOUT
; Step 6 ($50 virtual equity mirroring the real account floor, XAUUSD).
; 2026-09-17: restored after unregistered chart drift (mode=2 / session 12-16
; found live at 09:57 attach); this file is now the complete key set so
; scripts/set_chart_preset.py can splice it byte-exact. v1.09 keys pinned at
; their code defaults — InpLiveExecution=false is hard (paper arm forever,
; live authorization is a frozen-gate event, never an input edit).
; Symbol: XAUUSD (charter: gold only)
InpMagic=7801001
InpArmTag=M1
InpMode=0
InpMacroEmaPeriod=20
InpBBPeriod=20
; 2026-09-22: 2.0 -> 1.5, following the family pin (gold_preset_upcomers.BB_DEV, and
; midas_parity.BB_DEV). The strategy may not vary between presets — only the MODE does, and
; this control stays ORIGINAL (protocol §2/§10 Amendment 2). tests/test_midas_golive_grammar.py
; asserts every preset against one literal for exactly that reason. Measurement:
; docs/FREQUENCY_AXES_PREREG_20260922.md. This control is attached to no chart today, so
; nothing live changes here; the file moves so the family runs ONE strategy.
InpBBDev=1.5
InpRSIPeriod=14
InpRSIUpper=70.0
InpRSILower=30.0
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpSlAtrMult=2.0
InpTpMult=2.0
InpTimeoutMinutes=720
InpSessionStartHour=6
InpSessionEndHour=20
InpSpreadCapPctStop=2.5
InpFridayCutoffHour=20
InpUseNewsFilter=false
InpStaleMinutes=30
InpRiskPercent=1.0
InpMaxRiskPct=15.0
InpLiveExecution=false
InpPaperEquity=50.0
InpDeviationPoints=20
InpOrderRetries=3
InpFridayFlatHour=20
InpDailyLossCapPct=3.0
; v1.19 P6 build block: entry TF explicit (M15 = certified; no behavior change)
InpEntryTF=15
InpBarModel=false
InpSpreadFile=MIDASTOUCH_spread_M15.csv
InpWindowStart=0
InpWindowEnd=0
